window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-b1af804010bca37b"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"chatgpt-dot\">在 ChatGPT 移动应用中创建你的 dot（专属智能体）</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-135e664cbdfe4444?anchor=october-59-2026\">返回新内容</a></p> <p>2026 年 10 月 5–9 日</p> <p>现在，你可以在 ChatGPT 移动应用中创建自己的 dot（专属智能体）。用手机就能为它命名、 自定义外观并连接插件。你还可以选择在打开 ChatGPT 时直接进入与 dot 的对话， 方便随时接着上次的进度继续。</p> <p><a href=\"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/docs/dots/demos/dots-demo-mobile-onboarding-1080p-v1.webm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 ChatGPT 移动应用中创建并个性化设置你的 dot。（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"bring-your-dot-into-your-codex-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"dot-codex\">让 dot 参与 Codex 工作</h2> <p>dot 可以在 Codex 中启动工作，也能跟进已有的任务对话。它可以搜索你的 ChatGPT 对话，并利用现有 Codex 任务对话和自动化中的上下文。 它也更善于判断什么时候应该延续已有的 Codex 任务对话、什么时候应该新建一个， 让相关工作更容易归在一起。</p> <p>dot 还可以读取和编辑 ChatGPT Work 自动化。你可以让它检查已经安排的任务， 或在需求变化时更新定期执行的任务。</p> <p><a href=\"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/docs/dots/demos/dots-demo-codex-tasks-1080p-v1.webm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">通过手机让 dot 启动并管理 Codex 任务。（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"other-improvements\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">其他改进</h2> <ul> <li><strong>工作更快、更流畅：</strong>云端浏览和侧栏加载更快。 我们减少了等待回复时的停顿，让对话记录的滚动和动画更流畅， 并修复了可能造成网络用量过大的问题。</li> <li><strong>减少不必要的通知：</strong>修复了你正在使用 ChatGPT 时， 手机仍收到多余通知的问题。</li> <li><strong>网页版对话更清晰：</strong>改进了代码块和附件，并修复了 Safari 和 Firefox 中的字符显示问题。dot 管理的任务对话可以随着工作内容的变化自动重命名， 冗余的“已创建任务”消息也更少了。</li> <li><strong>设置过程更可靠：</strong>修复了 Outlook 设置卡住的问题， 并新增了电子邮件验证码自动填充功能。</li> <li><strong>更方便审阅和恢复：</strong>计划相关的指引更清楚，你也可以重试加载未能显示的活动。 网页版的安全提示条更加稳定，审批按钮不再被过大的 Gmail 预览裁切或遮挡。</li> <li><strong>Enterprise（企业版）访问更可靠：</strong>修复了网页版访问和发起语音通话时的访问问题。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"start-working-with-your-dot\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"dot\">开始与 dot 一起工作</h3> <p>了解 dot 能做些什么，将它连接到你的工具，并把需要持续处理的工作交给它。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">认识你的 dot</a></p>","en":"<h1 id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\">Create your dot in the ChatGPT mobile app</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-135e664cbdfe4444?anchor=october-59-2026\">Back to What's new</a></p> <p>October 5–9, 2026</p> <p>You can now create your dot in the ChatGPT mobile app. Give it a name, customize its appearance, and connect plugins, all from your phone. You can also choose to open ChatGPT directly to your dot’s conversation, so it’s ready when you want to pick up where you left off.</p> <p><a href=\"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/docs/dots/demos/dots-demo-mobile-onboarding-1080p-v1.webm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create and personalize your dot in the ChatGPT mobile app. (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"bring-your-dot-into-your-codex-work\">Bring your dot into your Codex work</h2> <p>Your dot can start work in Codex and follow up on existing threads. It can search across your ChatGPT conversations and use context from your existing Codex threads and automations. It’s also better at deciding when to continue an existing Codex thread and when to start a new one, helping keep related work together.</p> <p>Your dot can read and edit ChatGPT Work automations, too. Ask it to review what’s scheduled or update a recurring task as your needs change.</p> <p><a href=\"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/docs/dots/demos/dots-demo-codex-tasks-1080p-v1.webm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ask your dot to start and manage Codex tasks from your phone. (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"other-improvements\">Other improvements</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Faster, smoother work:</strong> Cloud browsing and sidebar loading are faster. We’ve reduced pauses while waiting for replies, smoothed transcript scrolling and animations, and fixed an issue that could cause excessive network usage.</li> <li><strong>Fewer unnecessary notifications:</strong> Fixed extra phone notifications while you’re already using ChatGPT.</li> <li><strong>Clearer conversations on the web:</strong> Improved code blocks and attachments, and fixed character rendering in Safari and Firefox. Threads your dot manages can rename themselves as the work changes, with fewer redundant “created task” messages.</li> <li><strong>More reliable setup:</strong> Fixed Outlook setup getting stuck and added autofill for email verification codes.</li> <li><strong>Easier review and recovery:</strong> Plan guidance is clearer, and you can retry activity that fails to load. Safety banners are more stable on the web, and approval buttons no longer get clipped or hidden by oversized Gmail previews.</li> <li><strong>More reliable Enterprise access:</strong> Fixed access issues on the web and when starting a voice call.</li> </ul> <h3 id=\"start-working-with-your-dot\">Start working with your dot</h3> <p>Explore what your dot can do, connect it to your tools, and give it ongoing work to take care of.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">Meet your dot</a></p>"};
